 "accommodation": {
  "name": "Gloria Serenity Resort",
  "blurb": "Home for the second year running – after 2023 we concluded there was no need to change a winning formula. Gloria Serenity is a five-star, all-inclusive resort on the Belek coast, around 40 minutes from Antalya airport, set in landscaped gardens with a huge saltwater pool winding around the grounds, villas with their own private pools, and a fine-sand beach and pier on the Mediterranean.\n\nGloria's Old and New courses sit right on the doorstep for Rounds II and III, with Carya – ranked the No.1 course in Turkey – a 20-minute shuttle away for Round I. Four nights, three rounds, buggies and all food and drink were included, and the late nights finished at the Resort Club.",
